	(text "J15 centre pin = +24 V.  F1 || F3: 2.2 A hold.  Q4/Q6 back to back: power\nswitch (SW9, soft start) + reverse-polarity block, no diode drop.  +24V: own trace from\nC12 to each load (U2 VS, U3 9 V buck, U5 5 V buck, J16, F2 -> J20 the lid).\nOne ground (v12): two solid ground planes (In1, In2) on the 4-layer board;\nthe input return lands at C12.  Keep each switching loop local."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 82.55 0)
		(effects
