	(text "SW11 OFF (A): gate = source through R88 1k: Q8 off within ~1 ms; MOT_24V decays, D16 dark, MOT_ON low.\nSW11 ON (C): R83 pulls the gate down (Vgs -9.6 V; -15.6 V at the 38.9 V clamp); C82 / R84 ramp it ~20 ms.\nMOT_24V: U2 VS (C2, C38, C3, C39) and F4 -> the head.  Positioning only: off for incubation and unattended runs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3be2dd84-658e-47dd-a8e0-43adc1cd2cf5")
	)
	(text "9 V SERVO RAIL, ON THE HEAD (v8): HEAD_24V -> U3 TPS5430 -> L1 22 uH -> +9V (9.16 V, 3 A) for U4/U8/U9.\nOff while V9_OFF is high (acquisition).  D6 clamps the 9 V if a braking motor pumps it (the buck can't sink)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 353.06 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.778 1.778))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd7c51be-646a-4b7b-9ff5-e3dddd5b1002")
	)
