	(text "24 V SOFT START (head v9): a live plug of the ribbon charges only D15 and Q3 (~1 A for ~1 us), not C18 / C53 (46-83 A);\nQ3 then ramps HEAD_24V_SS over a few ms, ~4-25 ms after contact.  No capacitor on HEAD_24V: that keeps the plug\ncurrent low.  C77 <= 1 uF: more delays the ramp past U3's UVLO hold-up.  Re-plug >= 1 s after unplugging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 469.9 287.02 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a73f46b5-9ebe-4a3f-b955-4bfd4dd7e34e")
	)
