	(text "VS 24 V: C3 (100 uF) + C38 + C2 next to VS/GND pad.  Sense: 3 x 1 R per coil (0.33 R), own vias to GND;\nfull scale 0.66 A RMS (vsense = 0, also the reset default); 0.4 A run = IRUN ~18.  R55 holds STEP low.\nEN pulled high (driver off) until firmware enables it; R1 1k: single-wire UART (TX1 -> PDN_UART <- RX1)."
