	(text "IN1/IN2: Teensy PWM through 1k into the ribbon; the DRV8251A inputs (100k pull-downs) are on the head.\nPWM drive/brake at 40-80 kHz (fwd: IN1 = 1, IN2 = PWM); IN1 = IN2 = 0 coasts.\nIPROPI: 3.47 V/A from the head (2k2 there); 1k + 10n here, into the Teensy ADC (3.3 V = 0.95 A).\n9 V for the drivers goes up the ribbon (2 conductors; 4 GND conductors, one beside each signal group)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 348 299.72 0)
		(effects
